  "abstract": "Capacity sweep on the increment head: increase hidden size to H=128 on the best LN config (k=320,p=32,\u03b3_end=0.99,a_max=0.993). Keep MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) and V-OrthoReg (\u03bb=1e-5).",
